---
/*
 * 04.7: a common 5-pin PCB relay seen from above (what is printed on the
 * case) and from below (where each pin is). Generic, no brand.
 */
---

<svg viewBox="0 0 560 280" width="560" height="280" class="fig" aria-hidden="true">
  <text x="140" y="24" class="title">
    Visto de cima
  </text>
  <rect x="30" y="40" width="220" height="170" rx="10" class="case" />
  <text x="140" y="78" class="print big">
    RELÉ 12VDC
  </text>
  <text x="140" y="104" class="print">
    10A 250VAC 10A 30VDC
  </text>

  <!-- printed diagram: coil and changeover contact -->
  <g transform="translate(70 140)">
    <rect x="0" y="12" width="26" height="34" class="sym" />
    <path d="M0 46 L26 12" class="sym thin" />
    <path d="M13 0 V12 M13 46 V58" class="sym" />
    <path d="M30 29 H70" class="sym thin dash" />
    <path d="M100 58 V44 L120 18" class="sym" />
    <path d="M90 0 V14 M128 0 V14" class="sym" />
    <circle cx="90" cy="16" r="2.4" class="dot" />
    <circle cx="128" cy="16" r="2.4" class="dot" />
  </g>

  <text x="420" y="24" class="title">
    Visto de baixo (pinos)
  </text>
  <rect x="320" y="40" width="200" height="170" rx="10" class="case under" />
  <circle cx="356" cy="72" r="7" class="pin coil" />
  <circle cx="356" cy="125" r="7" class="pin com" />
  <circle cx="356" cy="178" r="7" class="pin coil" />
  <circle cx="484" cy="72" r="7" class="pin" />
  <circle cx="484" cy="178" r="7" class="pin" />

  <text x="372" y="77" class="lbl start">
    bobina
  </text>
  <text x="372" y="130" class="lbl start">
    COM
  </text>
  <text x="372" y="183" class="lbl start">
    bobina
  </text>
  <text x="468" y="77" class="lbl end">
    NF
  </text>
  <text x="468" y="183" class="lbl end">
    NA
  </text>

  <text x="280" y="244" class="note">
    Um arranjo comum de pinos. Outros relés usam outro: confira sempre o desenho do
  </text>
  <text x="280" y="262" class="note">
    próprio relé ou meça com o multímetro (veja o roteiro mais abaixo).
  </text>
</svg>

<style>
  .fig {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    fill: none;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .case {
    fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--info) 18%, var(--surface));
    stroke: var(--info);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }
  .case.under {
    fill: color-mix(in oklab, var(--fg-subtle) 14%, var(--surface));
    stroke: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .sym {
    stroke: var(--fg);
    stroke-width: 1.8;
  }
  .sym.thin {
    stroke-width: 1.2;
  }
  .sym.dash {
    stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
  }
  .dot {
    fill: var(--fg);
  }
  .pin {
    fill: var(--bg);
    stroke: var(--fg-muted);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }
  .pin.coil {
    stroke: var(--copper);
  }
  .pin.com {
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }
  text {
    stroke: none;
    fill: var(--fg);
    font-size: 14px;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }
  .title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .print {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .print.big {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .lbl {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    fill: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .start {
    text-anchor: start;
  }
  .end {
    text-anchor: end;
  }
</style>
